Added repository package catalog and metrics endpoints, plus ``collapse_builds`` and ``base_version`` on the Python package content API. The catalog includes ``last_updated``, ``ordering``, newest-first PEP 440 ``versions``/``latest_releases``, and ``name_normalized`` prefix/substring search (at least 3 characters). Existing installs pick up access policy for the new actions on migrate unless the policy was customized.
